{"ref":"BDB, חָרוּץ","hw":"חָרוּץ","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָרוּץ</span></big>  <strong>adj. sharp, diligent (</strong>on this and foll. v. Ba<sup>NB 173</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">חָרוּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.27\">Is 28:27</a> + 11 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרוּצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.4\">Pr 10:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.24\">12:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרֻצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.4\">Pr 13:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרֻצוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:3\" href=\"/Amos.1.3\">Am 1:3</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>sharp:</em> of threshing instrument <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹרָג ח׳ חָדָשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.15\">Is 41:15</a>; without <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span>, as subst., <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.27\">28:27</a> (where <span dir=\"rtl\">יוּדַשׁ</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הַבַּרְזֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:3\" href=\"/Amos.1.3\">Am 1:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 41:22\" href=\"/Job.41.22\">Jb 41:22</a> (fig. of crocodile).<br><strong>2.</strong>  fig. <em>diligent:</em> as subst. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.5\">Pr 21:5</a>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְמִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.4\">Pr 10:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.24\">12:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.27\">27</a>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָצֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.4\">Pr 13:4</a>.—<a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:25\" href=\"/Daniel.9.25\">Dn 9:25</a> v. iv. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, חָרוּץ⁴\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_חָרוּץ⁴\">חרוץ</a>.","next":"BDB, חָרוּץ²","prev":"BDB, חָרַץ"}